uired prompts; the number of pasted lines corresponds to the number of images generated.\n\n4.Single-angle control is visualized through the ComfyUI-qwenmultiangle node. Download link: https://github.com/jtydhr88/ComfyUI-qwenmultiangle\n\n5.Adjust resolution settings in the Parameter Selection Area.\n\n6.An optional AIO model loader is included. However, tests show that the AIO model has lower character consistency compared to the original 2511 model. It is provided for specific use cases, with version 18.1 (the most effective one) included instead of the latest updates.\n\n7.Fine-tune other parameters based on your specific requirements.\n\n8.The angles in this workflow are controlled via prompts and are still subject to the limitations of prompt engineering. For precise angle control, the Gaussian splatting feature is required.\n\nDeepwhiteAI: https://civitai.com/user/DeepWhiteAI"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "Note", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#653", "size": [450, 370], "pos": [-949.0076293945312, 2809.54931640625], "id": 129, "properties": {"ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.3"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 27}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#432", "widgets_values": ["此工作流可以在线免费测试，觉得好用再下载本地运行，地址：\nhttps://www.runninghub.cn/post/2018253621518929922/?inviteCode=rh-v1443\n注册就送1000点，每天登录还有100点，单图运行20点左右！\n\n使用说明：\n\n1.此工作流使用Qwen-Image-Edit2511原版模型，配合lora模型multiple-angles生成多角度，或是手动控制角度来生成不同角度图片的工作流。可用于制作分镜及制作lora素材库。\n\n2.多角度和单角度控制由开关控制，每次仅需使用一种功能。\n\n3.多角度提示词有注释可供选择，需要的时候粘贴复制。复制几行就出几张图。\n\n4.单角度控制使用ComfyUI-qwenmultiangle节点可视化控制。下载地址：https://github.com/jtydhr88/ComfyUI-qwenmultiangle\n\n5.参数选择区可以控制分辨率。\n\n6.还准备了AIO模型加载器可供选择，但是经过测试，AIO模型人物一致性不如原版2511模型，但放了效果最好的18.1版本而不是最近新版本。\n\n7.其余参数根据需求自行调整。\n\n8.该工作流的角度是使用提示词控制，仍然受制于提示词。如果需要精确角度控制，需要用到高斯泼溅功能。\n\nDeepwhiteAI:https://civitai.com/user/DeepWhiteAI"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "Note", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#653", "size": [450, 370], "pos": [-95